            <div xml:id="d712">

                <pb facs="0608" n="596" xml:id="pg596"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">890D.01/593: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the Consul General at
                        Beirut</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Engert</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1942-05-05T22:00:00-04:00">May 5, 1942—10
                            p.m.</date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>62. Your 155, May 1, 10 a.m. The Department concurs with your recommendations,
                    and requests you to proceed along the line you have indicated.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Hull</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
